                  http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible"
                  content="IE=edge"
                  style="margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; border: none"
                /&gt;
                &lt;meta
                  name="viewport"
                  content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
                  style="margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; border: none"
                /&gt;
                &lt;style type="text/css"&gt;
                  body {
                    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
                      Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, "Open Sans", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
                    color: #313132;
                  }
                  p {
                    margin-top: 24px;
                    margin-bottom: 0;
                  }
                  #Serve_Legal_Documents {
                    overflow: visible;
                    line-height: 30px;
                    text-align: left;
                    font-style: normal;
                    font-weight: bold;
                    font-size: 20px;
                    color: rgba(0, 51, 102, 1);
                    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
                    vertical-align: middle;
                  }
                  #Congratulations {
                    overflow: visible;
                    line-height: 24px;
                    text-align: left;
                    font-style: normal;
                    font-weight: bold;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
                    margin-bottom: 32px;
                  }
                  .link {
                    overflow: visible;
                    line-height: 24px;
                    text-align: left;
                    overflow-wrap: break-word;
                    word-wrap: break-word;
                    font-style: normal;
                    font-weight: normal;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    color: #1a5a96;
                    text-decoration: underline;
                  }
                  .link:hover {
                    text-decoration: none;
                    color: blue;
                  }
                  .info {
                    overflow: visible;
                    line-height: 24px;
                    text-align: left;
                    font-style: normal;
                    font-weight: normal;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    color: #313132;
                    letter-spacing: 0px;
                    text-align: justify;
                  }
                &lt;/style&gt;
              &lt;/head&gt;
              &lt;body&gt;
                &lt;table style="width: 580px"&gt;
                  &lt;tr&gt;
                    &lt;td style="width: 151px"&gt;
                      &lt;img
                        style="width: 151px"
                       
            src="https://delightful-forest-018edef1e.azurestaticapps.net/img/BCID_H_rgb_pos_150.png"
                      /&gt;
                    &lt;/td&gt;
                    &lt;td&gt;&lt;span id="Serve_Legal_Documents"&gt;Serve Legal
            Documents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
                  &lt;/tr&gt;
                &lt;/table&gt;
                &lt;table style="width: 580px"&gt;
                  &lt;tr&gt;
                    &lt;td&gt;&lt;hr color="#DBDCDC" size="1px" /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
                  &lt;/tr&gt;
                  &lt;tr&gt;
                    &lt;td&gt;
                      &lt;p id="Congratulations"&gt;
                        Your Notice of Constitutional Question has been served on the
                        Attorney General of British Columbia
                      &lt;/p&gt;
                      &lt;p class="info"&gt;
                        We confirm the Notice of Constitutional Question you uploaded to
                        Serve Legal Documents was served on the Attorney General of British
                        Columbia today. If the document(s) you uploaded to Serve Legal
                        Documents are not a Notice of Constitutional Question and any
                        supporting documents, the document(s) have
            &lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;not&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt; been
                        served. At this time, the Serve Legal Documents portal is
                        &lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;not&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt; available to serve any documents
            except Notices of
                        Constitutional Question and supporting documents. A list of options
                        available to serve other types of documents is available
                        &lt;a
                          class="link"
                         
            href="https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/governments/organizational-structure/ministries-organizations/ministries/justice-attorney-general/ministry-contacts/serving-legal-documents"
                          &gt;here&lt;/a
                        &gt;.
                      &lt;/p&gt;
                      &lt;p class="info"&gt;
                        If you have any questions, please contact us at
                        &lt;a class="link" href="mailto:aglsblitigationect@gov.bc.ca"
                          &gt;aglsblitigationect@gov.bc.ca&lt;/a
                        &gt;.
                      &lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;/td&gt;
                  &lt;/tr&gt;
                  &lt;tr&gt;
                    &lt;td style="padding-top: 24px"&gt;&lt;hr color="#DBDCDC" size="1px"
            /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
                  &lt;/tr&gt;
                &lt;/table&gt;
              &lt;/body&gt;
            &lt;/html&gt;"</text>
        </outputEntry>
      </rule>
